    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83636" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλέθρ-ον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>measure of length of</i>
